PDrive for Linux - third-party notices
======================================

PDrive for Linux is free software, GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE). It is an unofficial
third-party client for Proton Drive and is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, Proton AG.

This file lists the third-party components that the binary packages ship or are built
from. It is a factual inventory: the licence texts are the ones delivered by each project,
not reproduced or rewritten here. The inventories in licenses/ are generated by
scripts/audit-licenses.sh (audit of 29/10/2026); re-run it when Cargo.lock or the pinned Proton
revisions change.

1. Proton Drive SDK (libproton_drive_sdk.so)
