   - Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Proton AG
   - Licence text: LICENSE.md of that repository; shipped in the native archive as
     LICENSE-proton-sdk.md and, once built, in third_party/sdk/LICENSE.md.
   - Compiled with .NET NativeAOT: the library embeds the .NET runtime (Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.
     NativeAOT.linux-x64 10.0.14, MIT) and the NuGet packages restored for it. Inventory with
     licence and copyright of each package taken from its .nuspec: licenses/nuget-sdk.tsv (36 packages,
     role "linked" or "build"). Linked packages: Microsoft.Extensions.* and related Microsoft
     packages (MIT), CommunityToolkit.HighPerformance (MIT), Google.Protobuf (BSD-3-Clause), Polly and
     Polly.Core (BSD-3-Clause), SQLitePCLRaw.* (Apache-2.0), SQLite 3.54.0 (its LICENSE.txt states
     "SQLite is Public Domain"), Proton.Cryptography (our own pack of item 2: its nuspec has no
     licence, the MIT licence of dotnet-crypto applies).
   - The .NET runtime pack ships its own THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.TXT (zlib-ng, Brotli, libunwind, LLVM,
     xxHash, Unicode data, ...). It is delivered in the native archive and the packages as
     LICENSE-dotnet-runtime.txt and LICENSE-dotnet-runtime-third-party-notices.txt.
   - Build-time only, not linked nor distributed: Grpc.Tools (Apache-2.0), ILCompiler and ILLink
